Firstly, armour doesn't always evaporate when enchanted past +5 (or
+4); there's a 1-in-n chance a +n piece of armor will survive.
Secondly, elven armour and wizard's cornuthaums will always be safe
below +6. The most likely situation is that Lorenz enchanted elven
armour to +6 or +7 and polymorphed it into other armour.



